Description: Rockchip RK3588 (Orange Pi) terminal monitor
 Terminal-based live monitor for Rockchip boards such as Orange Pi 5 / CM5.
 Shows per-core CPU load and frequency, RKNPU core load, Mali GPU load,
 memory usage and all thermal zones with colored bars and history
 sparklines. Optional CSV logging. Pure Python 3, no extra dependencies.
